OL,3,CTrump takes swipe at media and jokes
OL,4,Cabout running for a third term
OL,6,FDonald Trump delivered a rambling,
OL,7,Fhour-long speech claiming the media
OL,8,Fare "all going to be broke" when he
OL,9,Fwas no longer in the White House as
OL,10,F"there's not going to be anybody to
OL,11,Freport on".
OL,13,FThe US President made scathing remarks
OL,14,Fabout celebrities, political rivals
OL,15,Fand journalists at the rescheduled
OL,16,FWhite House Correspondents'
OL,17,FAssociation dinner on Friday night.
OL,26,@pD@EOUpD@[O]rD@AOUsD@JO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/16
