OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1784999905
OL,3,CTrump takes swipe at media and jokes
OL,4,Cabout running for a third term
OL,6,FAs well as poking fun at the press,
OL,7,Fwith whom he has a fractious
OL,8,Frelationship, Trump also joked about
OL,9,Frunning for a third term and donned a
OL,10,Fred "Trump 2028" cap during his speech.
OL,12,FRecalling the previous event being cut
OL,13,Fshort when a gunman opened fire in
OL,14,FApril and calling it an "attempted
OL,15,Fmass murder", he praised the Secret
OL,16,FService and law enforcement for their
OL,17,Fswift action, and said it "was a hell
OL,18,Fof an evening".
OL,26,@rD@EOUrD@PO]vD@YOUwD@LO]yD@[OUzD@NO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30803
