CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1784999905
OL,3,CTrump takes swipe at media and jokes
OL,4,Cabout running for a third term
OL,6,FTrump told the pared-down black-tie
OL,7,Fevent attended by only about 700
OL,8,Fpeople: "As I said three months ago,
OL,9,Fthe show must go on."
OL,11,FHe added: "But just like my
OL,12,Fpresidency, the second time is always
OL,13,Fbetter. It's always better, and the
OL,14,Fthird time will be better yet. I'm
OL,15,Fonly kidding."
OL,17,FTrump also quipped about a Grammy-
OL,18,Fnominated singer and supporter, who
OL,19,Fhad been invited to the April gala.
OL,26,@pD@IOUqD@UO]sD@KOUwD@NO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/16
