OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1784999905
OL,3,CTrump takes swipe at media and jokes
OL,4,Cabout running for a third term
OL,6,FHe said: "After hearing the gunshots,
OL,7,Fmany people yelled, 'Get down! Get
OL,8,Fdown!' which caused Nicki Minaj to
OL,9,Fstart twerking."
OL,11,FBut striking a serious note, the
OL,12,Fpresident said: "Tonight we come back
OL,13,Ftogether to answer that heinous attack
OL,14,Fwith unwavering resolve, and every one
OL,15,Fof us here this evening to show that
OL,16,Fin America we do not yield to
OL,17,Fpolitical violence.
OL,26,@nD@JOUqD@PO]tD@QOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/16
