OL,3,CTrump takes swipe at media and jokes
OL,4,Cabout running for a third term
OL,6,F"In this country, we believe in
OL,7,Ffreedom of speech. We settle our
OL,8,Fdifferences not with bullets, but with
OL,9,Fopen and vigorous debate, and no
OL,10,Fderanged loser with a gun will ever
OL,11,Fchange that."
OL,13,FThe suspect, 31-year-old Cole Tomas
OL,14,FAllen, from California, pleaded not
OL,15,Fguilty in May to charges, including
OL,16,Fattempting to assassinate the
OL,17,Fpresident.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@MO]
