OL,3,CTrump takes swipe at media and jokes
OL,4,Cabout running for a third term
OL,6,FAmong those honoured during the
OL,7,Fevening was Secret Service officer
OL,8,FVictor Gonzales, who was shot in the
OL,9,Fattack back in April, but had been
OL,10,Fwearing his protective vest.
OL,12,FIn his speech, Trump blended humour
OL,13,Fwith barbs at what he frequently
OL,14,Fbrands as the "fake news media".
OL,16,FHe said: "This place is really the
OL,17,Flargest group of Trump derangement
OL,18,Fsyndrome people ever put together at
OL,19,Fone time."
OL,26,@vD@OOUvD@_O]xD@JOU{D@JO]
