OL,3,CTrump takes swipe at media and jokes
OL,4,Cabout running for a third term
OL,6,FBut close allies also did not escape
OL,7,Fthe ribbing, with Trump singling out
OL,8,Fhis health secretary Robert F Kennedy
OL,9,FJr, who previously admitted to
OL,10,Fcollecting roadkill and storing it in
OL,11,Fa freezer.
