OL,3,CTrump takes swipe at media and jokes
OL,4,Cabout running for a third term
OL,6,FReferring to the "very delicious beef"
OL,7,Featen at the dinner, the president
OL,8,Fsaid: "I want you all to know that
OL,9,FBobby Kennedy, who's right here,
OL,10,Fpersonally ran over the cow in his
OL,11,Fcar, and he cut it up and he brought
OL,12,Fit here for you to eat tonight, so
OL,13,Fit's very fresh."
OL,15,FBut while largely light-hearted, Trump
OL,16,Fappeared to reserve his most scathing
OL,17,Fcomments for his political critics,
OL,18,Fincluding the singer Bruce Springsteen.
OL,26,@nD@ROUnD@fO]pD@GOUuD@QO]
