OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1784999905
OL,3,CTrump takes swipe at media and jokes
OL,4,Cabout running for a third term
OL,6,FHe derided the star for making
OL,7,Fpolitical speeches during his concerts
OL,8,Fto the extent he suggested the
OL,9,Fperformer's tour should be renamed
OL,10,F"Bored in the USA".
OL,12,FThe audience, reacting at first with
OL,13,Fsome friendly laughs, slowly quieted
OL,14,Fto scattered titters as the insults
OL,15,Fpiled up for the likes of Jane Fonda
OL,16,Fand "Barack Hussein Obama", as Trump
OL,17,Fcalled his predecessor.
OL,19,FAmong other targets of Trump's humour
OL,20,Fwere late-night hosts Jimmy Fallon and
OL,21,FJimmy Kimmel.
OL,26,@rD@AOUrD@RO]xD@EOUxD@ZO]
