OL,3,CTrump takes swipe at media and jokes
OL,4,Cabout running for a third term
OL,6,FThere were some potentially
OL,7,Funcomfortable moments during the
OL,8,Fevening where journalists received
OL,9,Fawards for critical reports of the
OL,10,Fpresident, including where he had
OL,11,Fthreatened them with legal action,
OL,12,Falthough he notably stood to shake
OL,13,Ftheir hands in congratulations.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/16
