OL,3,CTrump takes swipe at media and jokes
OL,4,Cabout running for a third term
OL,6,FNearing the end of his speech, Trump
OL,7,Fsaid: "I hope all of you know that I
OL,8,Fbelieve in the free press more than
OL,9,Fanyone in this room does. Maybe not
OL,10,Fquite, but that's why I'm proud to be
OL,11,Fthe most open and transparent
OL,12,Fpresident in history. They call me
OL,13,Fthat."
OL,15,FHe told the audience: "When I'm gone,
OL,16,Fyou're all going to be broke. Your
OL,17,Fbusiness model is going to be finished.
OL,26,@oD@GOUuD@FO]wD@WOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/16
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
