OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1784999905
OL,3,CTrump takes swipe at media and jokes
OL,4,Cabout running for a third term
OL,6,F"When I'm not around, you're going to
OL,7,Fbe broke. There's not going to be
OL,8,Fanybody to report on. Nobody gives a
OL,9,Fdamn about anybody else."
OL,11,FDescribing it as an "interesting"
OL,12,Fevening, Trump said: "I really didn't
OL,13,Fknow what to expect. And it's far
OL,14,Fworse than I actually thought."
OL,16,FHe added: "Sometimes I don't feel you
OL,17,Ftreat me fair. Maybe you do. I don't
OL,18,Fknow. I don't feel that.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@YO]sD@UOUsD@aO]tD@VOUvD@_O]xD@
OL,26,AKOU
