OL,3,CTrump takes swipe at media and jokes
OL,4,Cabout running for a third term
OL,6,F"But sometimes you treat me very
OL,7,Ffairly, and I have a lot of respect
OL,8,Ffor your profession. Your profession
OL,9,Fis amazing, and I just want to thank
OL,10,Fyou for having me.
OL,12,F"And it's been fun, and I've met a lot
OL,13,Fof great people."
OL,15,FEarlier, speaking at the start of the
OL,16,Fevent, WHCA president Weijia Jiang of
OL,17,FCBS News joked: "Let's try this again."
OL,19,FBut she added: "Tonight our message is
OL,20,Fthis: We are back.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUuD@QO]yD@QOUyD@gO]{D@POU
