OL,3,CTrump takes swipe at media and jokes
OL,4,Cabout running for a third term
OL,6,F"We will not be intimidated. We refuse
OL,7,Fto let an act of violence have the
OL,8,Ffinal word."
OL,10,FThe curtailed April dinner was the
OL,11,Ffirst Trump had agreed to attend while
OL,12,Fin office, having boycotted previous
OL,13,Fevents.
