OL,3,CTrump takes swipe at media and jokes
OL,4,Cabout running for a third term
OL,6,FHis administration has often had a
OL,7,Fhostile relationship with the press,
OL,8,Fwhich he claims to be biased,
OL,9,Ffrequently dismissing coverage and
OL,10,Freporters as "fake news", taking legal
OL,11,Faction against media organisations,
OL,12,Fincluding the BBC, New York Times, CNN
OL,13,Fand the Wall Street Journal, and
OL,14,Fcurbing journalists' access.
OL,16,FAhead of the dinner, hundreds of
OL,17,Fformer journalists and a number of
OL,18,Fprofessional journalism groups had
OL,19,Fsigned a letter calling on the WHCA to
OL,20,Fchallenge the administration's
OL,21,F"egregious" actions.
OL,26,@rD@NOUrD@XO]}D@AOU}D@KO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G15/16
